{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAUCHO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an action adventure, where combat demands your concentration to the maximum in order to survive the attacks of colossal enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring subway stations in an apocalyptic Buenos Aires, defeat the Demon Bosses one by one to escape to the surface and save your kitten.<br><br><strong>Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with powerful enemies, where you'll need to learn from them by fighting over and over until you manage to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Station Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node-based levels. Each step forward opens and closes paths. Explore and re-explore the stations to discover all their routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the boss fights at each station, face other minions inside the stations, practice and improve with them. Gain experience and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, you'll have to make decisions; Help a stranger, walk into an obvious trap to reach a new item, convince someone to ally with you. You'll need to choose wisely...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272390?t=1749849476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749849476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272390/690c2b14e64fd707f6590755f60bc76e051a3a68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749849476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272390/690c2b14e64fd707f6590755f60bc76e051a3a68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749849476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains combat with enemies, humans, beasts and monsters where some blood may be seen during confrontations."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3797760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAUCHO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an action adventure, where combat demands your concentration to the maximum in order to survive the attacks of colossal enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring subway stations in an apocalyptic Buenos Aires, defeat the Demon Bosses one by one to escape to the surface and save your kitten.<br><br><strong>Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with powerful enemies, where you'll need to learn from them by fighting over and over until you manage to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Station Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node-based levels. Each step forward opens and closes paths. Explore and re-explore the stations to discover all their routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the boss fights at each station, face other minions inside the stations, practice and improve with them. Gain experience and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, you'll have to make decisions; Help a stranger, walk into an obvious trap to reach a new item, convince someone to ally with you. You'll need to choose wisely...</p>","developers":["SymbioStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272390/header.jpg?t=1749849476","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cl